            "description": "Search Swedish rental listings by city, SEK monthly cost, rooms, furnishing, pets and contract type; paginated results.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\nThe provider identifies `records` as the primary payload key.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `bedroomCount` | number |  |\n| `blockListing` | boolean |  |\n| `currency` | string |  |\n| `endDate` | string |  |\n| `firstHand` | boolean |  |\n| `furnished` | boolean |  |\n| `homeType` | string |  |\n| `id` | string |  |\n| `location` | object |  |\n| `monthlyCost` | number |  |\n| `petsAllowed` | boolean |  |\n| `publishedAt` | string |  |\n| `rent` | number |  |\n| `roomCount` | number |  |\n| `source_url` | string |  |\n| `squareMeters` | number |  |\n| `startDate` | string |  |\n| `studentHome` | boolean |  |\n| `tenantBaseFee` | number |  |\n| `wheelchairAccessible` | boolean |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
